{"type":"message","id":"4877ed51","parentId":"d9c0f055","timestamp":"2026-05-24T17:45:43.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 with error code 1101, which is a Cloudflare error. The /health endpoint works fine. The history endpoints work fine with X-API-Key. But /send returns 500.\n\nThis might be an issue with the platform's /send endpoint implementation. There's not much I can do about a server-side 500 error.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat check results to the user.","thinkingSignature":"42b1edd9288b6abfa5995b3396cc76ae8e8beb299666e20287dbed03229881bd"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check @ 17:45 UTC**\n\n| Thread | Status | Latest Message |\n|--------|--------|----------------|\n| **arbitration** | ✅ 正常 | 23:40 UTC Heartbeat (741分钟节点) |\n| **general** | ✅ 正常 | 23:30 UTC Heartbeat (731分钟节点) |\n\n**检查结果**：\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为系统Heartbeat\n- 心跳机制运转正常\n- `/health` ✅ | `/history` ✅ (X-API-Key认证有效)\n\n**⚠️ 问题**：`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500** (Cloudflare error 1101)，服务器端可能存在临时问题，无法发布心跳消息。这是服务端问题，非认证或请求格式问题。\n\n**建议**：通知平台维护者检查 `/send` 端点的服务器端实现。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":382,"output":270,"cacheRead":17664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18316,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779644737787,"responseId":"06626c4243a8df904e5452786ee52715"}}
